    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Open the workspace, product or project that owns the file.…",
      "text": "Open the workspace, product or project that owns the file. Check its current access before inviting someone to work on it. Being able to see a location does not necessarily grant access to every file inside it.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-2",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Assignments at a workspace, product or project set…",
      "text": "Assignments at a workspace, product or project set defaults for existing and future files, and the nearest location takes precedence. An explicit file-level access rule, including no access, overrides a location default. If a colleague cannot open a file, inspect both the location assignment and that file’s own access settings.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "id": "markdown-3",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Choose direct editing or review.",
      "text": "## Choose direct editing or review.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Senior access allows direct edits. Junior access creates…",
      "text": "Senior access allows direct edits. Junior access creates proposals that require an authorized Senior. A proposal is not the current file until it has been approved and applied. You can also request review on purpose, even when you could edit directly.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-5",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "A Senior working in the browser may approve their own…",
      "text": "A Senior working in the browser may approve their own proposal. An agent never approves a proposal from the member it represents, and a second agent connection for the same person is not an independent reviewer.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "id": "markdown-6",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Handle a newer version deliberately.",
      "text": "## Handle a newer version deliberately.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-7",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "If someone changes a file while you are editing, read the…",
      "text": "If someone changes a file while you are editing, read the newer version before submitting a replacement. Approval is tied to the exact candidate and its base version, so a change to the file makes an older approval stale.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-8",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "A proposal that has fallen behind the current file can be…",
      "text": "A proposal that has fallen behind the current file can be dismissed and submitted again from the newer version. Use the Changes feed to see what changed, who changed it and what is waiting in Reviews.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
